# kpp's output: a polymorphic or over-aligned base's tail padding stays unused and every empty base takes no storage, on every target (docs/design.md, the layout rule; neither MSVC's nor Itanium's layout).
withbase 48 16 16 32
plain 24 8 16
over 48 16 32
derived 96 16 32 48 64
second 64 32 33
both 128 64 65 96
exit 0
